# 0.2.9: user space only (ztMETRO + ztos-sounds: screenshot with flash and
# shutter, the camera pill and Rubik; ztsettings: the pill's look; zdoze;
# zsleepd's faster re-sleep; zcell keeps the modem quiet with the screen off;
# zmon in place of the zbattlog loop). No module changed since 0.2.8;
# KERNEL_FILES is cumulative (see 0.2.3.env), the same as 0.2.8's.
KERNEL_FILES="usr/local/lib/zboot/tools/zrn-system-sleep-bx.ko usr/local/lib/zboot/tools/snd-zrn-abox-bx.ko usr/local/lib/zboot/tools/zrn-s6sy761.ko usr/lib/modules/7.1.0-zboot/extra/brcmfmac.ko usr/lib/modules/7.1.0-zboot/extra/pcie-exynos9820.ko usr/local/lib/zboot/zrn-modem.ko"
